<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-053-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.291634" lon="-120.895991"><name>SC26-053-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.7 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 73/100; not catch probability. Center 48 ft; nearby 44–73 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-037</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.289798976720874" lon="-120.89675357911977"/><trkpt lat="35.28970886755232" lon="-120.8967559108604"/><trkpt lat="35.289777339100375" lon="-120.89698578553921"/><trkpt lat="35.29009404441022" lon="-120.89760029979941"/><trkpt lat="35.290716195388754" lon="-120.89819657446647"/><trkpt lat="35.29147807542297" lon="-120.89845708088218"/><trkpt lat="35.29226369703502" lon="-120.89834215032947"/><trkpt lat="35.29295345512902" lon="-120.89786927009239"/><trkpt lat="35.293442336559814" lon="-120.8971104269463"/><trkpt lat="35.29365590961604" lon="-120.89618115072676"/><trkpt lat="35.29356165788506" lon="-120.89522292429282"/><trkpt lat="35.29317393166632" lon="-120.89438163878421"/><trkpt lat="35.29255176249053" lon="-120.89378537724612"/><trkpt lat="35.29178987391964" lon="-120.89352491224545"/><trkpt lat="35.291004258432146" lon="-120.89363988823892"/><trkpt lat="35.29031451753623" lon="-120.89411279132395"/><trkpt lat="35.289825654302696" lon="-120.89487162134108